1. c4 Nf6 2. Nc3 e6 3. e4 Bb4? { Looks like the Nimzo-Indian pin, but White's pawn is on e4 and can push with tempo. }
4. e5 Ne4? { Jumping forward looks natural, but the knight on e4 has no support. The only retreat was 4...Ng8. } 5. Nxe4 { White wins a knight for nothing: nothing guards e4, and Black cannot take back. } *
